We use a lot of singletons in model parallel code and they are initialized as follows:
Bar foo() {
 static Bar bar;
 return bar;
}

As per https://isocpp.org/wiki/faq/ctors#construct-on-first-use-v2, this is not safe and we should use static raw pointers instead.
